{"title":"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/f/9ef4e218098a91c89148413dd509a0f63ae1c535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^3}{10^2 - 6^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"70\" height=\"42\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7ae3beca5c043649e833894fa6f3610b1b4e365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0.5 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ -35.36 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 1.5 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"471\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can just simplify the fraction:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/5/51510396e03323ce159f28f2b334bf407e3ec7c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^3}{10^2 - 6^2} = \\frac{64}{100 - 36} = \\frac{64}{64} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"293\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.5\">Solution 1.5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can also use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a> to find the value of the denominator:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4b62b63333c119e737fed7365958a91a82d8aaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4^3}{10^2 - 6^2} = \\frac{4 \\times 4^{2}}{(10 - 6)(10 + 6)} = \\frac{4 \\times 16}{4 \\times 16} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"384\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat\">2006 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat 